  "notes": "USAGE:\nA common term in news and political discourse. Can be used with する as a suru verb: {減税|げんぜい}する (to cut taxes). The opposite is {増税|ぞうぜい} (tax increase).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {減税|げんぜい}する: to cut taxes\n- {大幅|おおはば}な{減税|げんぜい}: a large tax cut\n- {減税|げんぜい}{措置|そち}: tax reduction measures\n- {減税|げんぜい}{政策|せいさく}: tax cut policy",
